          %h2#References References
          %p A careful non-technical exposition is in
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Sebastian De Haro, Jeroen van Dongen, Manus Visser,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jeremy+Butterfield"} Jeremy Butterfield
                %em Conceptual Analysis of Black Hole Entropy in String Theory
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1904.03232"}> arXiv:1904.03232
                )
            %li
              %p
                Jeroen van Dongen, Sebastian De Haro, Manus Visser,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jeremy+Butterfield"} Jeremy Butterfield
                %em Emergence and Correspondence for String Theory Black Holes
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1904.03234"}> arXiv:1904.03234
                )
          %h3#introductions_and_review Introductions and Review
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Juan+Maldacena"}> Juan Maldacena
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Black Holes in String Theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9607235"} arXiv:hep-th/9607235
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Juan+Maldacena"}> Juan Maldacena
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Black Holes and D-branes
